# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EXPLICIT OPT-IN: sanitized, small PUBLIC test fixtures (repository-root path).
# These final rules override ALL rules above, including media/data extensions.
# Every file here can be committed: review for faces, names, EXIF/GPS, private
# records, credentials, and size before adding. Never place real secrets here.
# Keep tests/ and tests/fixtures/ traversable even if broader rules are added.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/tests/
!/tests/fixtures/
!/tests/fixtures/public/
!/tests/fixtures/public/**
